// SECTION 3: TRACE SAMPLING
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

/// *
/// TraceConfig configures trace sampling for high-volume systems.
///
/// FORMAL DEFINITION:
/// Sampling config S = (rate, filters, strategy) where:
